Method-level choices (builder's call per ODD §1.1):

  - PM workspace-state at <workspace>/workspace/.loam/pms/<handle>/
    per F2.A — adopts canonical WORKSPACE_STATE_SUBDIR convention
    from workspace_paths.py:99, sibling of M-FBM at
    workspace/.loam/memory/. Parent plan said
    <workspace>/.loam/pms/; corrected to canonical convention to
    align with M-FBM precedent. Method-level decision; not an
    escalation.
  - Pydantic v2 (model_config = ConfigDict, field_validator) per
    existing primary-persona / workspace-bootstrap pattern.
  - PMContract + DecisionSurfacingPolicy frozen (state mutation
    via state.yaml/decision-queue.yaml, not via mutating contract).
  - composes_with_skills + composes_with_agents are advisory at
    Cycle 2 (recorded but not enforced) per F2.B; Cycle 4+ wires.
  - PerProjectPMContribution publishes a factory (lazy resolution)
    not eager-loaded PMs per F2.C; matches the auto-load semantics
    without requiring PM authoring at workspace-bootstrap time.
  - PMNotFoundError = normal not-found at the loader boundary;
    empty_state_for() helper for the "no PM authored yet" callsite
    path per F2.D.
  - audit-log <NNNN> = 4-digit zero-padded monotonic counter
    scoped to (pm-name, UTC date), reset at midnight UTC per F2.E;
    computed at write time by reading directory listing
    (stdlib only, no SQLite).
  - Atomic write = tmp+rename + fsync, mirroring M-FBM convention.
  - Cycle 2.a (design-note + scaffold + contract.py) + Cycle 2.b
